\newlabel{fig:outbox-sequence}{{5}{4}{Responder outbox protocol: the steady-state field-submission path from tablet to incident journal. The journal assigns the authoritative sequence number, and duplicate delivery is handled by \textit {client\_event\_id}}{figure.5}{}}
